	<key>guide.verify.body</key>
	<string>Client is running, the PID and the start time confirm that the process is alive. Open Logs and check the messages about connecting to the server and any errors. Then open a site that should use the VPN. If you check your public IP, expect the VPN server’s exit address and account for your routing rules. A running process alone does not confirm that traffic is passing through the tunnel.</string>
	<key>guide.verify.title</key>
	<string>4. Check the connection</string>
